  "id": "artane",
  "term": "Artane",
  "definition": "Artane is a brand name for trihexyphenidyl hydrochloride, a medication with anticholinergic effects that is used mainly in Parkinson's disease. It works by blocking acetylcholine activity at muscarinic receptors, helping rebalance movement-related signaling in the basal ganglia and reduce symptoms such as rigidity and tremor.",
